body:
When a Payload admin list view shows 'Loading...' for relationship cells, the default RelationshipCell tries to async-fetch the related doc's useAsTitle field per row — which can fail silently. The fix is to add a custom Cell component on the field that renders directly from cellData/fieldData (populated by the list query's depth parameter).

Pattern used:
```typescript
// field in collection config
{
  name: 'sourceLesson',
  type: 'relationship',
  relationTo: 'lessons',
  admin: {
    components: {
      Cell: '@/ui/admin/LessonDuplications/Cells/SourceLessonCell#SourceLessonCell',
    },
  },
}
```

Cell component receives cellData (the populated object) and fieldData (string ID) props — check both for backwards compat.
